# Reviewed for readable setup and analysis terminology.
#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:233
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Setup registers REA's MCP connection and installs the matching investigation"
" skill. Restart your agent when it finishes, then give it a target path and "
"a question. {ph0}Follow the setup guide{ph1} for prerequisites and your "
"first analysis."
msgstr ""
"Perintah penyiapan mendaftarkan koneksi MCP REA dan memasang skill analisis "
"yang sesuai. Setelah selesai, mulai ulang agen lalu berikan jalur file dan "
"pertanyaan. {ph0}Panduan penyiapan{ph1} menjelaskan kebutuhan awal dan "
"langkah analisis pertama."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:242
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Which coding agents can use REA?"
msgstr "Agen pengkodean mana yang dapat menggunakan REA ?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:243
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Any agent that supports local MCP servers. Setup includes Claude Code, "
"Claude Desktop, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Windsurf, Devin, OpenCode, "
"Antigravity, GitHub Copilot CLI, Command Code, Grok Build, OMP, and VS Code."
" Grok Bot's connector is added from its chat."
msgstr ""
"Agen apa pun yang mendukung server MCP lokal. Pengaturan termasuk Claude "
"Code , Claude Desktop, Codex , Cursor , Gemini CLI , Windsurf , Devin , "
"OpenCode , Antigravity , GitHub Copilot CLI , Command Code , Grok Build , "
"OMP , dan VS Code . Konektor Grok Bot ditambahkan dari obrolannya."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/#agent">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:250
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Connect your coding agent{ph1}."
msgstr "{ph0}Hubungkan agen pengkodean Anda{ph1}."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:255
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "How do I update REA?"
msgstr "Bagaimana cara memperbarui REA ?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:256
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA releases frequently, including bug fixes. If you installed the CLI with "
"npm:"
msgstr ""
"REA sering dirilis, termasuk perbaikan bug. Jika Anda menginstal CLI dengan "
"npm :"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:262
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Terminal · installed CLI"
msgstr "Terminal * terpasang CLI"

#. {ph0}: <code>npx</code>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:274
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Follow the setup refresh command printed by the update. If you set up your "
"agent through {ph0}, run:"
msgstr ""
"Ikuti perintah penyegaran penyiapan yang dicetak oleh pembaruan. Jika Anda "
"mengatur agen Anda melalui {ph0}, lari:"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:280
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Terminal · refresh agent setup"
msgstr "Terminal * pengaturan agen penyegaran"

# Reviewed for readable setup and analysis terminology.
#. {ph0}: <code>npx -y rea-agents@latest</code>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:292
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Review the changes and restart your agent. Its REA connection pins a package"
" version, so refreshing setup makes it use the new release. For one-off CLI "
"commands, use {ph0} followed by the command."
msgstr ""
"Periksa perubahan dan mulai ulang agen. Koneksi REA menggunakan versi paket "
"tertentu, jadi jalankan penyiapan lagi agar agen memakai versi baru. Untuk "
"satu kali perintah CLI, tambahkan perintah setelah {ph0}."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:300
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Is installing the skill from skills.sh enough?"
msgstr "Apakah memasang keterampilan dari skills.sh cukup?"

#. {ph0}: <a href="#install">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:303
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"The skill gives your agent investigation instructions. Run {ph0}REA "
"setup{ph1} to connect the MCP server and install the matching skill, then "
"restart your agent so it can call the tools."
msgstr ""
"Keterampilan tersebut memberikan instruksi penyelidikan agen Anda. Lari "
"{ph0} Pengaturan REA{ph1} untuk menghubungkan server MCP dan menginstal "
"keterampilan yang cocok, mulai ulang agen Anda sehingga dapat memanggil "
"alat."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:314
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "Analisis"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:317
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "What can I analyze with REA?"
msgstr "Apa yang dapat saya analisis dengan REA ?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:318
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Start with the kind of software you have:"
msgstr "Mulailah dengan jenis perangkat lunak yang Anda miliki:"

