#: website/public/faq/index.html:320
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Native executables and libraries{ph1}: functions, assembly, pseudocode "
"and references."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Executable dan pustaka asli{ph1}: fungsi, perakitan, pseudocode, dan "
"referensi."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/javascript/" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/faq/index.html:325
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}JavaScript and Electron apps{ph1}: modules, imports, IPC and source "
"locations."
msgstr ""
"{ph0} Aplikasi JavaScript dan Electron{ph1}: modul, impor, IPC, dan lokasi "
"sumber."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/browser/">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:330
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Browser pages{ph1}: scripts, requests and runtime observations."
msgstr "{ph0}Halaman browser{ph1}: skrip, permintaan, dan pengamatan runtime."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../showcase/">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:335
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA also has workflows for managed assemblies, Android APKs, firmware and "
"packaged resources. {ph0}See the case studies{ph1} for worked "
"investigations."
msgstr ""
"REA juga memiliki alur kerja untuk rakitan terkelola, APK Android, firmware,"
" dan sumber daya yang dikemas. {ph0}Lihat studi kasus{ph1} untuk investigasi"
" yang berhasil."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:343
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Do I need Hopper, Ghidra or IDA?"
msgstr "Apakah saya memerlukan Hopper, Ghidra atau IDA ?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:344
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Deep native analysis uses one of them. Static JavaScript and .NET inspection"
" work with the supplied files and do not need a native analysis engine."
msgstr ""
"Analisis mendalam terhadap program kode mesin menggunakan salah satunya. "
"Pemeriksaan JavaScript dan. NET statis bekerja dengan file yang disediakan "
"dan tidak memerlukan analisis program kode mesin mesin."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/#native">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:349
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Connect your existing Ghidra or IDA installation, or let setup detect Hopper"
" and propose an installation. Your host and target determine which provider "
"can be used. {ph0}Set up native analysis{ph1}."
msgstr ""
"Hubungkan instalasi Ghidra atau IDA Anda yang sudah ada, atau biarkan setup "
"mendeteksi Hopper dan usulkan instalasi. Host dan target Anda menentukan "
"penyedia mana yang dapat digunakan. {ph0}Menyiapkan analisis program kode "
"mesin{ph1}."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:357
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Can I use REA without a coding agent?"
msgstr "Dapatkah saya menggunakan REA tanpa agen pengkodean?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:358
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Yes. The CLI uses the same analysis workflows. For a local JavaScript or "
"Electron app:"
msgstr ""
"Ya. CLI menggunakan alur kerja analisis yang sama. Untuk aplikasi JavaScript"
" atau Electron lokal:"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:364
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Terminal · static application analysis"
msgstr "Terminal * analisis aplikasi statis"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/#terminal">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:377
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace the path with an extracted application folder or ASAR file. {ph0}Use"
" the CLI{ph1} for installation options."
msgstr ""
"Ganti jalur dengan folder aplikasi yang diekstraksi atau file ASAR. "
"{ph0}Gunakan CLI {ph1} untuk opsi instalasi."

# Reviewed for readable setup and analysis terminology.
#: website/public/faq/index.html:384
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "What code does REA return?"
msgstr "Kode apa yang dikembalikan REA?"

# Reviewed for readable setup and analysis terminology.
#: website/public/faq/index.html:385
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Native analysis returns assembly and pseudocode, with calls, references and "
"relevant constants. JavaScript analysis returns modules, their relationships"
" and source locations."
msgstr ""
"Analisis program native mengembalikan assembly dan pseudocode, beserta "
"pemanggilan fungsi, referensi, dan konstanta terkait. Analisis JavaScript "
"mengembalikan modul, hubungan antarmodul, dan lokasi dalam kode sumber."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../showcase/dx-ball/#sound-pan" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <a href="../showcase/ctf/">
#. {ph3}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:390
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Your agent uses these findings to explain the behavior or write and test an "
"implementation. The {ph0}DX-Ball calculation{ph1} and {ph2}CTF flag "
"checker{ph3} show how that process works."
msgstr ""
"Agen Anda menggunakan temuan ini untuk menjelaskan perilaku atau menulis dan"
" menguji implementasi. The {ph0} Perhitungan DX-Ball{ph1} dan {ph2}Pemeriksa"
" bendera KKP{ph3} tunjukkan bagaimana proses itu bekerja."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:401
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "What should I ask my agent?"
msgstr "Apa yang sebaiknya saya tanyakan kepada agen?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:402
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Give it a local target and one behavior to investigate. For a JavaScript or "
"Electron app:"
msgstr ""
"Berikan target lokal dan satu perilaku untuk diselidiki. Untuk aplikasi "
"JavaScript atau Electron:"

