#. {ph1}: <i>
#. {ph2}: </i>
#. {ph3}: <i>
#. {ph4}: </i>
#. {ph5}: <i>
#. {ph6}: </i>
#. {ph7}: </span >
#: website/public/faq/index.html:408
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Your coding agent"
msgstr "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Agen pengkodean Anda"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:431
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace the path with your target. The {ph0}guides{ph1} provide prompts for "
"native, Electron and browser examples."
msgstr ""
"Ganti jalur dengan target Anda. The {ph0}panduan{ph1} berikan petunjuk untuk"
" contoh asli, Electron, dan browser."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:441
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Pemecahan masalah"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:444
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Why can't my agent see the REA tools?"
msgstr "Mengapa agen saya tidak dapat melihat alat REA?"

#. {ph0}: <code>doctor</code>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:445
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Restart or reconnect your agent after setup. Check its REA registration with"
" {ph0}; for Codex:"
msgstr ""
"Mulai ulang atau sambungkan kembali agen Anda setelah penyiapan. Periksa "
"pendaftaran REA-nya dengan {ph0}; untuk Codex :"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:451
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Terminal · check one client"
msgstr "Terminal * periksa satu klien"

#. {ph0}: <code>codex</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>claude_code</code>
#. {ph2}: <code>cursor</code>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:463
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace {ph0} with your client ID, such as {ph1} or {ph2}. If the report "
"shows a missing or stale registration, run setup for that client:"
msgstr ""
"Ganti {ph0} dengan ID klien Anda, seperti {ph1} atau {ph2}. Jika laporan "
"menunjukkan pendaftaran yang hilang atau kedaluwarsa, jalankan penyiapan "
"untuk klien tersebut:"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:471
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Terminal · repair one client's setup"
msgstr "Terminal * perbaiki pengaturan satu klien"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/#help">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:483
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Review its plan and restart the client. If registration is healthy but tools"
" remain absent, check the client's MCP connection error. {ph0}More setup "
"diagnostics{ph1}."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau rencananya dan mulai ulang klien. Jika pendaftaran sehat tetapi alat "
"tetap tidak ada, periksa kesalahan koneksi MCP klien. {ph0}Lebih banyak "
"diagnostik pengaturan{ph1}."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:491
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Do I need to start Hopper first?"
msgstr "Apakah saya harus memulai Hopper terlebih dahulu?"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/#native">
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/faq/index.html:492
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA starts Hopper when an operation needs it. On macOS, complete the first-"
"run choice of demo mode or license activation before unattended analysis. "
"{ph0}See native provider setup{ph1}."
msgstr ""
"REA memulai Hopper saat operasi membutuhkannya. Pada macOS, selesaikan "
"pilihan mode demo atau aktivasi lisensi yang dijalankan pertama kali sebelum"
" analisis tanpa pengawasan. {ph0}Lihat penyiapan penyedia asli{ph1}."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:501
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "What should I do if I hit a bug?"
msgstr "Apa yang harus saya lakukan jika menemukan bug?"

#. {ph0}: <a href="#update">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:502
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Update REA{ph1}, restart your agent and retry the same task. A recent "
"release may already fix the problem."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Perbarui REA {ph1}, mulai ulang agen Anda dan coba lagi tugas yang "
"sama. Rilis terbaru mungkin sudah memperbaiki masalah."

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/issues/new/choose" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/faq/index.html:506
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"If it persists, {ph0}open an issue{ph1} with your REA version, operating "
"system, target type, steps to reproduce and error output. Include the "
"provider name when the problem involves native analysis."
msgstr ""
"Jika terus berlanjut, {ph0}buka masalah{ph1} dengan versi REA Anda, sistem "
"operasi, jenis target, langkah-langkah untuk mereproduksi, dan keluaran "
"kesalahan. Sertakan nama penyedia saat masalah melibatkan analisis program "
"kode mesin."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:520
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Data and sharing"
msgstr "Data dan berbagi"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:523
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Does REA upload my app?"
msgstr "Apakah REA mengunggah aplikasi saya?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:524
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA analyzes targets on your machine. Your agent receives the results, and "
"its model provider's data policy applies to those results."
msgstr ""
"REA menganalisis target pada mesin Anda. Agen Anda menerima hasilnya, dan "
"kebijakan data penyedia modelnya berlaku untuk hasil tersebut."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:531
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "How can I share an example or contribute?"
msgstr "Bagaimana saya bisa membagikan contoh atau berkontribusi?"

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/issues/new/choose" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/pulls">
#. {ph3}: </a >
#: website/public/faq/index.html:532
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Have a useful REA example? We'd love to see it. Share the target, your "
"question, the findings and how you checked them in an {ph0}issue{ph1} or "
"{ph2}pull request{ph3}. Short code excerpts and figures help others follow "
"the investigation."
msgstr ""
"Punya contoh REA yang berguna? Kami ingin melihatnya. Bagikan target, "
"pertanyaan Anda, temuan, dan cara Anda memeriksanya dalam sebuah "
"{ph0}masalah{ph1} atau {ph2}tarik permintaan{ph3}. Kutipan kode pendek dan "
"angka membantu orang lain mengikuti penyelidikan."

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://discord.gg/GkcryMnJDM">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:544
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Bug reports, feature requests, documentation and code improvements are "
"welcome too. You can also discuss an example in the {ph0}community{ph1}."
msgstr ""
"Laporan bug, permintaan fitur, dokumentasi, dan peningkatan kode juga "
"diterima. Anda juga dapat mendiskusikan sebuah contoh di "
"{ph0}komunitas{ph1}."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:6
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "REA FAQ: Setup, Updates and Troubleshooting"
msgstr "FAQ REA: Penyiapan, Pembaruan, dan Pemecahan Masalah"

