msgstr "Atau jalankan perintah ini di terminal Anda:"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:261
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Review the plan, approve the setup, then restart your agent. Already "
"connected? Continue below."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau paket, setujui penyiapan, lalu mulai ulang agen Anda. Sudah "
"terhubung? Lanjutkan di bawah ini."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:267
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "2. Ask where the CSV is written"
msgstr "2. Tanyakan di mana CSV ditulis"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:268
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The example is a six-file Electron app with an {ph0}Export notes{ph1} "
"button. Your agent can inspect its code without installing or launching "
"Electron."
msgstr ""
"Contohnya adalah aplikasi Electron enam file dengan {ph0}Ekspor catatan{ph1}"
" tombol. Agen Anda dapat memeriksa kodenya tanpa menginstal atau meluncurkan"
" Electron ."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:303
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Your agent downloads the files and gives the unpacked folder to REA for "
"inspection."
msgstr ""
"Agen Anda mengunduh file dan memberikan folder yang belum dibongkar ke REA "
"untuk diperiksa."

#. {ph0}: <a class="button" href="../examples/notes-example.zip"
#. download="notes-example.zip" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:307
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Download example ZIP{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Unduh contoh ZIP{ph1}"

#. {ph0}: <code>notes-example</code>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:315
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"If your agent can’t download files, unzip this archive yourself. Give it the"
" path to the {ph0} folder and the same export question."
msgstr ""
"Jika agen Anda tidak dapat mengunduh file, buka zip arsip ini sendiri. "
"Berikan jalan ke {ph0} folder dan pertanyaan ekspor yang sama."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:322
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "3. Follow the answer back to the code"
msgstr "3. Ikuti jawabannya kembali ke kode"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:323
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Look for a short explanation with file and line references:"
msgstr "Cari penjelasan singkat dengan referensi file dan baris:"

#. {ph0}: <code>notes:export</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>notes.csv</code>
#. {ph2}: <code>id</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>title</code>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:325
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The button sends a {ph0} message. The main process formats the notes as CSV "
"and writes {ph1} in the user’s Downloads folder. The columns are {ph2} and "
"{ph3}."
msgstr ""
"Tombol tersebut mengirimkan {ph0} pesan. Proses utama memformat catatan "
"sebagai CSV dan menulis {ph1} di folder Unduhan pengguna. Kolomnya adalah "
"{ph2} dan {ph3}."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:333
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "From the button to the file writer"
msgstr "Dari tombol ke penulis file"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:362
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA’s static analysis pairs the message with its handler. The destination is"
" read from code."
msgstr ""
"Analisis statis REA memasangkan pesan dengan penangannya. Tujuan dibaca dari"
" kode."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:378
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The file path, formatter and write call are together in this handler. Ask "
"your agent to show these lines if its answer leaves them out."
msgstr ""
"Jalur file, pemformat, dan panggilan tulis digabungkan dalam penangan ini. "
"Minta agen Anda untuk menunjukkan baris-baris ini jika jawabannya tidak."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/javascript/#follow" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:383
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}See the full code trace and recorded REA result{ph1}."
msgstr "{ph0}Lihat jejak kode lengkap dan hasil REA yang direkam{ph1}."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:390
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "4. Check a prediction"
msgstr "4. Periksa prediksi"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:391
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"A comma separates CSV columns. What happens when a note title itself "
"contains a comma or quotation marks?"
msgstr ""
"Koma memisahkan kolom CSV. Apa yang terjadi jika judul catatan itu sendiri "
"berisi koma atau tanda petik?"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:435
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Run the check yourself"
msgstr "Jalankan cek sendiri"

#. {ph0}: <code>notes-example</code>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:436
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Open a terminal in the unpacked {ph0} folder:"
msgstr "Buka terminal di bagian yang belum dibongkar {ph0} folder:"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:458
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"This command uses a shell with here-document support, such as Bash or Zsh. "
"Your agent can run the same JavaScript in your platform’s shell."
msgstr ""
"Perintah ini menggunakan shell dengan dukungan here-document, seperti Bash "
"atau Zsh. Agen Anda dapat menjalankan JavaScript yang sama di shell platform"
" Anda."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:466
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "5. Ask another question"
msgstr "5. Ajukan pertanyaan lain"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:467
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Try a follow-up in the same conversation:"
msgstr "Coba tindak lanjut dalam percakapan yang sama:"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:469
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"What happens if the file can’t be written? Follow the error back to the "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Apa yang terjadi jika file tidak dapat ditulis? Ikuti kesalahan kembali ke "
"halaman."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:474
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Or give your agent an app of your own and ask about one button, file or "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"Atau berikan agen Anda aplikasi Anda sendiri dan tanyakan tentang satu "
"tombol, file, atau perilaku."

