#: website/public/get-started/index.html:368
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Run setup to connect REA to your coding agent. Client choices include Claude"
" Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Windsurf, Grok Build, and other supported "
"MCP clients. Grok Bot's connector is added from its chat."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan pengaturan untuk menghubungkan REA ke agen pengkodean Anda. Pilihan"
" klien termasuk Claude Code, Codex , Cursor , Gemini CLI , Windsurf , Grok "
"Build, dan klien MCP lain yang didukung. Konektor Grok Bot ditambahkan dari "
"obrolannya."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:375
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "New to coding agents?"
msgstr "Baru mengenal agen pengkodean?"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:376
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"A coding agent is an AI assistant that works on your computer instead of in "
"a browser tab. It can read files and run commands, and it asks before making"
" changes. REA gives it reverse-engineering tools."
msgstr ""
"Agen pengkodean adalah asisten AI yang berfungsi di komputer Anda, bukan di "
"tab browser. Itu dapat membaca file dan menjalankan perintah, dan bertanya "
"sebelum membuat perubahan.  REA memberikan alat rekayasa balik."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:382
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"If you don't have one yet, pick one, follow its install page and sign in:"
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda belum memilikinya, pilih salah satu, ikuti halaman pemasangannya "
"dan masuk:"

#. {ph0}: <strong >
#. {ph1}: <a href="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/setup" >
#. {ph2}: </a >
#. {ph3}: </strong >
