#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}{ph1}OpenCode{ph2}{ph3}, open source. Connect the model provider of "
"your choice."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}{ph1} OpenCode {ph2}{ph3}, sumber terbuka. Hubungkan penyedia model "
"pilihan Anda."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:407
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Then open it and copy the prompt below into it. The agent runs REA's setup "
"and shows you the plan before changing anything."
msgstr ""
"Kemudian buka dan salin prompt di bawah ini ke dalamnya. Agen menjalankan "
"pengaturan REA dan menunjukkan kepada Anda rencananya sebelum mengubah apa "
"pun."

