"{ph4} {ph5} {ph6}), lalu tekan Enter."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:477
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Choose your client and review the setup plan. REA adds its MCP connection "
"and the matching investigation skill, keeping a backup of existing "
"configuration. It asks before applying the changes."
msgstr ""
"Pilih klien Anda dan tinjau rencana penyiapan.  REA menambahkan koneksi MCP "
"dan keterampilan investigasi pencocokan, menyimpan cadangan konfigurasi yang"
" ada. Itu bertanya sebelum menerapkan perubahan."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:482
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Restart your client when setup finishes."
msgstr "Mulai ulang klien Anda saat penyiapan selesai."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:484
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "How do I restart my client?"
msgstr "Bagaimana cara memulai ulang klien saya?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <kbd>⌘</kbd>
#. {ph3}: <kbd>Q</kbd>
