#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Desktop apps{ph1} (Claude Desktop, Cursor, Windsurf, VS Code): quit the"
" app completely, then open it again. Closing the window isn't enough. On "
"macOS press {ph2} {ph3}; on Windows, also quit from the tray icon if there "
"is one."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Aplikasi desktop{ph1} (Claude Desktop, Cursor, Windsurf, VS Code): "
"keluar dari aplikasi sepenuhnya, lalu buka lagi. Menutup jendela saja tidak "
"cukup. Pada pers macOS {ph2} {ph3}; pada Windows, keluar juga dari ikon baki"
" jika ada."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:492
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Terminal agents{ph1} (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI): exit the session"
" and start it again."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Agen terminal{ph1} ( Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI): keluar dari sesi "
"dan mulai lagi."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:497
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Give your agent a target path and a specific question. For a JavaScript or "
"Electron app, you might start with:"
msgstr ""
"Berikan agen Anda jalur target dan pertanyaan spesifik. Untuk aplikasi "
"JavaScript atau Electron, Anda dapat memulai dengan:"

#. {ph0}: <code>/absolute/path/to/app</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:502
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Look at {ph0} and find how it exports data. Show the entry points, calls and"
" dependencies involved, with the source locations for your findings."
msgstr ""
"Lihat ini {ph0} dan temukan cara mengekspor data. Tampilkan titik masuk, "
"panggilan, dan dependensi yang terlibat, dengan lokasi sumber untuk temuan "
"Anda."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:508
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Replace the path with your local target."
msgstr "Ganti jalur dengan target lokal Anda."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:510
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
