msgstr "{ph0}x64 asli * instruksi yang dipilih{ph1} {ph2}{ph3}"

#: website/public/index.html:400
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "01 · Which branch?"
msgstr "01 * Cabang mana?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/index.html:401
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"“{ph0}0x5b? 0x5c?{ph1} Two jumps to the same place. Which operators are "
"these?”"
msgstr ""
"“{ph0}0x5b? 0x5c?{ph1} Dua lompatan ke tempat yang sama. Operator mana ini?”"

#: website/public/index.html:405
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Look up the command IDs, then label the branch."
msgstr "Cari ID perintah, lalu beri label pada cabang."

#: website/public/index.html:411
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Divide ÷"
msgstr "Membagi ÷"

#: website/public/index.html:415
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Multiply ×"
msgstr "Kalikan ×"

#: website/public/index.html:420
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "02 · What do the calls do?"
msgstr "02 · Apa yang dilakukan fungsi yang dipanggil?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong >
#: website/public/index.html:421
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"“100 is clear. The calls are just addresses. {ph0}Which one divides? Which "
"value goes in?{ph1}”"
msgstr ""
"\"100 sudah jelas. Panggilan itu hanya alamat. {ph0}Yang mana yang membelah?"
" Nilai mana yang masuk?{ph1}”"

#: website/public/index.html:426
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Inspect the helpers and trace the stored values."
msgstr "Periksa fungsi pembantu dan lacak nilai yang disimpan."

#: website/public/index.html:436
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Divide"
msgstr "Membagi"

#: website/public/index.html:441
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "03 · What is the rule?"
msgstr "03 · Apa aturannya?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/index.html:442
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"“This path multiplies by the other input. So {ph0}10% means 10% of 200{ph1} "
"after +.”"
msgstr ""
"\"Jalur ini dikalikan dengan masukan lainnya. Jadi {ph0}10% berarti 10% dari"
" 200{ph1} setelah +.”"

#: website/public/index.html:446
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Name the operands and check both operator paths."
msgstr "Beri nama operan dan periksa kedua jalur operator."

#: website/public/index.html:462 website/public/index.html:390
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Illustrative expert reasoning"
