"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Use REA to analyze ms_flag_checker and find the flag. "
"Explain how the checks work, then verify the answer with the original "
"program.{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Gunakan REA untuk menganalisis ms_flag_checker dan menemukan"
" benderanya. Jelaskan cara kerja pemeriksaan, lalu verifikasi jawabannya "
"dengan program aslinya.{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:289
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"An example prompt, with the downloaded challenge available locally and a "
"native analysis provider connected."
msgstr ""
"Contoh prompt, dengan tantangan yang diunduh tersedia secara lokal dan "
"analisis penyedia program kode mesin terhubung."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:295
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Follow the input prompt to its function"
msgstr "Ikuti prompt input ke fungsinya"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:324
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"The reference gives the agent a place to investigate, even though the "
"executable's original function names have been removed."
msgstr ""
"Referensi memberi agen tempat untuk menyelidiki, meskipun nama fungsi asli "
"yang dapat dieksekusi telah dihapus."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:331
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Read the checker and its two helpers"
msgstr "Baca pemeriksa dan dua pembantunya"

#. {ph0}: <code>0x18</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>0x270</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:359
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"The first loop copies 36 character codes. The checking loop decodes a mask, "
"sums the selected codes and compares the result with a stored number. Its "
"{ph0}-byte steps across {ph1} bytes give 26 masks."
msgstr ""
"Loop pertama menyalin 36 kode karakter. Loop pemeriksaan menerjemahkan "
"topeng, menjumlahkan kode yang dipilih, dan membandingkan hasilnya dengan "
"nomor yang disimpan. Nya {ph0}- langkah byte melintasi {ph1} byte memberikan"
" 26 topeng."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:367
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"These are selected results from a fresh REA analysis. The local target path "
"is shortened for display; addresses refer to REA's imported image."
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah hasil yang dipilih dari analisis REA baru. Jalur target lokal "
"dipersingkat untuk ditampilkan; alamat mengacu pada gambar yang diimpor REA."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:375
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "One check reveals one character"
msgstr "Satu cek mengungkapkan satu karakter"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:376
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"The checker arranges the input in a 6×6 grid. A mask chooses which cells "
"contribute to a sum. Its compact encoding uses negative numbers to skip "
"cells and positive numbers to select them."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksa mengatur masukan dalam kisi 6× Topeng memilih sel mana yang "
"berkontribusi pada penjumlahan. Pengkodeannya yang ringkas menggunakan angka"
" negatif untuk melewati sel dan angka positif untuk memilihnya."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../../assets/figures/ctf-mask-equation.svg" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:396
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "The seventh check selects just one position. {ph0}Open figure{ph1}."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan ketujuh hanya memilih satu posisi. {ph0}Sosok terbuka{ph1}."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:403
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Read the mask and its target from the binary"
msgstr "Baca topeng dan targetnya dari biner"

#. {ph0}: <code>MOVSX</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>eb</code>
#. {ph2}: <code>code[21] = 55</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>7</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:425
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"The instruction {ph0} reads mask bytes as signed values. This is why {ph1} "
"means −21. The target is a little-endian integer. Together, these bytes tell"
" the agent that {ph2}, so that character is {ph3}."
msgstr ""
"Instruksi {ph0} membaca byte topeng sebagai nilai yang ditandatangani. "
"Inilah mengapa {ph1} artinya -21. Targetnya adalah bilangan bulat little-"
"endian. Bersama-sama, byte ini memberi tahu agen bahwa {ph2}, jadi karakter "
"itu adalah {ph3}."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:434
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "From instructions to a readable check"
msgstr "Dari instruksi hingga pemeriksaan yang dapat dibaca"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:435
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"Select a step to connect the summing helper and its caller to the same rule "
"in C."
msgstr ""
"Pilih langkah untuk menghubungkan summing helper dan fungsi pemanggilnya ke "
"aturan yang sama di C."

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:445
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}01{ph1} Start"
msgstr "{ph0}01{ph1} Mulai"

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:453
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}02{ph1} Select"
msgstr "{ph0}02{ph1} Pilih"

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:461
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}03{ph1} Add"
msgstr "{ph0}03{ph1} Tambahkan"

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:469
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}04{ph1} Advance"
msgstr "{ph0}04{ph1} Maju"

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:477
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}05{ph1} Compare"
msgstr "{ph0}05{ph1} Bandingkan"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:489
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "REA · selected original instructions"
msgstr "REA * instruksi asli yang dipilih"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:513
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Readable C · one-check summary"
msgstr "Ringkasan satu cek C * yang dapat dibaca"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>ECX</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:542
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}01 · Start at zero.{ph1} {ph2} holds the running sum."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}01 * Mulai dari nol.{ph1} {ph2} memegang jumlah yang sedang berjalan."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:546
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}02 · Check the mask cell.{ph1} A zero value skips the character; a "
"nonzero value includes it."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}02 * Periksa sel topeng.{ph1} Nilai nol melewatkan karakter; nilai "
"bukan nol menyertakannya."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:550
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}03 · Add a character code.{ph1} The input's integer at the same offset "
"is added to the sum."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}03 * Tambahkan kode karakter.{ph1} Bilangan bulat input pada offset "
"yang sama ditambahkan ke jumlah."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:554
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}04 · Move to the next cell.{ph1} The original loop advances four bytes "
"per integer and visits six rows of six cells."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}04 * Pindah ke sel berikutnya.{ph1} Loop asli memajukan empat byte per "
"bilangan bulat dan mengunjungi enam baris dari enam sel."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>EAX</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>Incorrect!</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:559
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}05 · Compare with the stored target.{ph1} The caller receives the sum "
"in {ph2}. A mismatch jumps to {ph3}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}05 * Bandingkan dengan target yang disimpan.{ph1} Fungsi pemanggil "
"menerima jumlah dalam {ph2}. Ketidakcocokan melompat ke {ph3}."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:566
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"The instructions come from the summing helper and its caller. The C is an "
"explanatory summary with descriptive names and a flattened 36-cell loop."
msgstr ""
"Instruksi datang dari pembantu penjumlahan dan fungsi pemanggilnya. C adalah"
" ringkasan penjelasan dengan nama deskriptif dan loop 36 sel yang diratakan."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:574
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Solve the 26 equations"
msgstr "Selesaikan 26 persamaan tersebut"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:575
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"Most masks select several cells. For example, the first check adds 16 "
"character codes and requires a total of 1441. The overlapping selections "
"give equations that a small Python script can solve together."
msgstr ""
"Sebagian besar topeng memilih beberapa sel. Misalnya, pemeriksaan pertama "
"menambahkan 16 kode karakter dan membutuhkan total 1441. Pilihan yang "
"tumpang tindih memberikan persamaan yang dapat diselesaikan bersama oleh "
"skrip Python kecil."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:583
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Python · solver excerpt"
msgstr "Python * kutipan pemecah"

#. {ph0}: <code>DUCTF{…}</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:611
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"Z3 is a solver that finds values satisfying these equations. This excerpt "
"uses the extracted checks and assumes a {ph0} flag with letters, digits, "
"underscores and braces. The complete download includes all 26 masks and "
"targets."
msgstr ""
"Z3 adalah pemecah yang menemukan nilai-nilai yang memenuhi persamaan ini. "
"Kutipan ini menggunakan pemeriksaan yang diekstraksi dan mengasumsikan {ph0}"
" bendera dengan huruf, angka,garis bawah, dan tanda kurung. Unduhan lengkap "
"mencakup semua 26 topeng dan target."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:617
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Download the complete solver"
msgstr "Unduh pemecah lengkap"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:623
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Check the answer with the original program"
msgstr "Periksa jawabannya dengan program aslinya"

#. {ph0}: <code>z</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>y</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:624
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA's process capture records the original executable accepting the solved "
"flag. Changing one selected character from {ph0} to {ph1} makes the first "
"sum 1440 instead of 1441, and the program rejects it."
msgstr ""
"Pengambilan proses REA merekam executable asli yang menerima flag yang "
"diselesaikan. Mengubah satu karakter yang dipilih dari {ph0} untuk {ph1} "
"membuat jumlah pertama 1440, bukan 1441, dan program menolaknya."

