#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>[EBP+8]</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>FILD</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>x</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:524
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}01 · Read the input.{ph1} The instruction view in REA's function result"
" reads {ph2} and uses {ph3} to load the integer. Following its caller "
"through REA establishes the screen-coordinate meaning of the C parameter "
"{ph4}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}01 * Baca inputnya.{ph1} Tampilan instruksi dalam hasil fungsi REA "
"berbunyi {ph2} dan menggunakan {ph3} untuk memuat bilangan bulat. Mengikuti "
"fungsi pemanggilnya melalui REA menetapkan arti koordinat layar dari "
"parameter C {ph4}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>FMUL</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>0x420068</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>read_bytes</code>
#. {ph5}: <code>1.5625</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:531
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}02 · Multiply by 1.5625.{ph1} {ph2} reads the double at {ph3}. The "
"bytes returned by REA's {ph4} decode to {ph5}; the C uses the same constant."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}02 * Kalikan dengan 1,5625.{ph1} {ph2} membaca dobel di {ph3}. Byte "
"yang dikembalikan oleh REA {ph4} dekode ke {ph5}; C menggunakan konstanta "
"yang sama."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>FSUB</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>0x420070</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>500.0</code>
#. {ph5}: <code>320</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:537
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}03 · Subtract 500.0.{ph1} {ph2} reads the double at {ph3}. REA's byte "
"result decodes to {ph4}, shifting the calculation's center to screen "
"coordinate {ph5}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}03 * Kurangi 500,0.{ph1} {ph2} membaca dobel di {ph3}.  Hasil byte REA "
"diterjemahkan menjadi {ph4}, menggeser pusat perhitungan ke koordinat layar "
"{ph5}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>FMUL</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>0x4210a0</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>dxball_pan_scale</code>
#. {ph5}: <code>1.0</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:543
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}04 · Apply the stored scale.{ph1} The second {ph2} reads {ph3}. That "
"global is named {ph4} in the maintained source. REA's second byte read "
"establishes its initial value of {ph5}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}04 * Terapkan skala yang disimpan.{ph1} Yang kedua {ph2} membaca {ph3}."
" Global itu bernama {ph4} dalam sumber yang dipelihara.  Pembacaan byte "
"kedua REA menetapkan nilai awalnya dari {ph5}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>0x406430</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>__ftol</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>DxBallInt</code>
#: website/public/showcase/dx-ball/index.html:550
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/dx-ball/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}05 · Return an integer.{ph1} The call at {ph2} reaches {ph3}, "
"identified in REA's callee results. The C casts the result to {ph4}; "
"original-x86 comparisons check the returned value."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}05 * Mengembalikan bilangan bulat.{ph1} Panggilan di {ph2} jangkauan "
"{ph3}, diidentifikasi dalam hasil callee REA. C memberikan hasil ke {ph4}; "
"perbandingan original-x86 periksa nilai yang dikembalikan."

