msgstr "C++ yang dapat dibaca * ringkasan aimed-ring"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>SI</code>
#: website/public/showcase/th04/index.html:567
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/th04/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}01 · Read the bullet index.{ph1} The stack argument is loaded into "
"{ph2}. In a 16-bullet ring, this member index runs from 0 through 15."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}01 * Baca indeks poin.{ph1} Argumen tumpukan dimuat ke dalam {ph2}. "
"Dalam cincin 16 peluru, indeks anggota ini berjalan dari 0 hingga 15."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>SHL AX,8</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>IDIV</code>
#: website/public/showcase/th04/index.html:572
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/th04/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}02 · Space the directions around a full turn.{ph1} {ph2} multiplies by "
"256. The count is zero-extended into a word, then {ph3} divides the product "
"by that count. For count 16, each index advances 16 angle units."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}02 * Beri jarak arah di sekitar belokan penuh.{ph1} {ph2} dikalikan "
"dengan 256. Hitungannya nol-diperpanjang menjadi sebuah kata, lalu {ph3} "
"membagi produk dengan hitungan itu. Untuk hitungan 16, setiap indeks "
"memajukan 16 satuan sudut."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>AX</code>
#: website/public/showcase/th04/index.html:579
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/th04/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}03 · Add the player direction.{ph1} The two subtractions form player-"
"minus-origin coordinates. The direction helper returns an angle in {ph2}; "
"adding it turns the whole ring toward the player."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}03 * Tambahkan arah pemutar.{ph1} Kedua pengurangan tersebut membentuk "
"koordinat pemain-minus-asal. Helper arah mengembalikan sudut dalam {ph2}; "
"menambahkannya mengubah seluruh cincin ke arah pemain."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>ADD AL,[0x53ad]</code>
#: website/public/showcase/th04/index.html:585
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/th04/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}04 · Add the pattern's rotation.{ph1} {ph2} adds the template angle. "
"Elly's initial template sets it to zero; other patterns can use the same "
"helper with a rotation."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}04 * Tambahkan rotasi pola.{ph1} {ph2} menambahkan sudut templat. "
"Templat awal Elly menyetelnya ke nol; pola lain dapat menggunakan helper "
"yang sama dengan rotasi."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>AL</code>
#: website/public/showcase/th04/index.html:591
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/th04/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}05 · Keep the final angle in one byte.{ph1} The store writes {ph2} to "
"the spawn-angle field. Values wrap after 255, just as the unsigned-byte cast"
" does. The surrounding source also converts this angle and speed into "
"velocity."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}05 * Pertahankan sudut akhir dalam satu byte.{ph1} Toko menulis {ph2} "
"ke bidang spawn-angle. Nilai membungkus setelah 255, seperti yang dilakukan "
"oleh pemeran unsigned-byte. Sumber di sekitarnya juga mengubah sudut dan "
"kecepatan ini menjadi kecepatan."

#: website/public/showcase/th04/index.html:600
msgctxt "page:showcase/th04/index.html"
msgid ""
"The assembly selects the aimed-ring branch, aim calculation and final store."
" The C++ above is a readable summary. Compiler checks below apply to the "
"maintained source in the linked project."
msgstr ""
"Majelis memilih cabang aimed-ring, perhitungan aim, dan penyimpanan akhir. "
"C++ di atas adalah ringkasan yang dapat dibaca. Pemeriksaan kompiler di "
"bawah ini berlaku untuk sumber yang dipelihara dalam proyek tertaut."

